            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "NSTARK"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I find it annoying when people rate a recipe that they have changed beyond recognition of the original, but I am prepared to be somewhat of a hypocrite since this recipe has not yet been reviewed. I made an altered version of this -- maintaining the grapes, walnuts, red onion, and balsamic vinaigrette. The flavors went well together and I added chopped chicken and some fresh thyme. I left out the other ingredients because I either didn't have them (radishes) or didn't think they were needed (raisins). Ended up quite tasty."
          },
          {
